        },
        "quote": "(a) Any construction company who wishes to operate a temporary batch plant in conjunction with highway construction or construction of a major arterial street shall first make application for a temporary batch plant permit to the Code Enforcement Director. The application shall contain the following information:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.010:block:0#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 12.45.010 block 1",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 1,
          "component_id": "40ba5049-9175-5e30-868e-5436dabcb51f",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 372,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.010:block:1",
          "start": 314
        },
        "quote": "(1) Name and business address of the construction company.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.010:block:1#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 12.45.010 block 2",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 2,
          "component_id": "cf9ac85b-2ae2-58b5-8ad2-6d1f6f72b3cc",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 465,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.010:block:2",
          "start": 373
        },
        "quote": "(2) The highway or major arterial street project, designated by location and project number.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.010:block:2#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 12.45.010 block 3",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 3,
          "component_id": "e27effbd-8364-5d4f-8638-54d2958816dd",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 801,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.010:block:3",
          "start": 466
        },
        "quote": "(3) A map of the proposed site of the temporary batch plant including material storage. The map shall be drawn to scale and shall show the proposed site in relationship to the limits of construction. For purposes of this article, “site” shall be considered to be the geographical area proposed for the batch plant and material storage.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.010:block:3#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 12.45.010 block 4",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 4,
          "component_id": "6fc3c6c5-41b3-5429-b417-8ae52c5e38b9",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 873,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.010:block:4",
          "start": 802
        },
        "quote": "(4) Statement of the approximate duration of the temporary batch plant.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.010:block:4#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 12.45.010 block 5",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 5,
          "component_id": "367f5791-27a1-54bd-aeae-f87dc42687a9",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 943,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.010:block:5",
          "start": 874
        },
        "quote": "(5) Type of construction material to be assembled at the batch plant.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.010:block:5#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 12.45.010 block 6",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 6,
          "component_id": "32021667-edba-58d0-bca5-d01af0a131f3",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1020,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.010:block:6",
          "start": 944
        },
        "quote": "(6) Any other information deemed pertinent by the Code Enforcement Director.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.010:block:6#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 12.45.010 block 7",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 7,
          "component_id": "bc1594d0-55ef-5ddd-a7d6-9166c3253718",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1260,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.010:block:7",
          "start": 1021
        },
        "quote": "(b) Upon receipt of the application, the Code Enforcement Director shall review the application. The Code Enforcement Director shall also consult with the City Engineer and Traffic Engineer. The review shall include the following criteria:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.010:block:7#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 12.45.010 block 8",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 8,
          "component_id": "328a436d-a36c-562b-8b49-e24d178b7cc7",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1363,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.010:block:8",
          "start": 1261
        },
        "quote": "(1) The site of the proposed batch plant is not within 400 feet of any inhabited residential property.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.010:block:8#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 12.45.010 block 9",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 9,
          "component_id": "8a1d910e-5859-5a1b-8ca3-1c5f331b3726",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1474,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.010:block:9",
          "start": 1364
        },
        "quote": "(2) The site of the proposed batch plant is not within 250 feet of any commercial structures and/or buildings.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.010:block:9#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 12.45.010 block 10",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 10,
          "component_id": "e1394bee-4015-5d43-a3be-ea091bef8f01",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1544,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.010:block:10",
          "start": 1475
        },
        "quote": "(3) The site of the proposed batch plant has adequate ingress/egress.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.010:block:10#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 12.45.010 block 11",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 11,
          "component_id": "f9a8a02f-63e9-5179-ab27-c9c8310f74b7",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1633,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.010:block:11",
          "start": 1545
        },
        "quote": "(4) Operation of a batch plant at the proposed site will not endanger the public safety.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.010:block:11#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 12.45.010 block 12",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 12,
          "component_id": "88796eaa-3e58-576e-aaa2-97a60fe86ca7",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1787,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.010:block:12",
          "start": 1634
        },
        "quote": "(5) Evidence satisfactory to the Code Enforcement Director that the site will be returned to its original condition by the expiration date of the permit.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.010:block:12#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 12.45.010 block 13",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 13,
          "component_id": "cd890ebe-e110-5e21-a97c-5d77d9b29c80",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2276,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.010:block:13",
          "start": 1788
        },
        "quote": "(c) If the Code Enforcement Director finds the application meets the criteria stated in this section, a permit for the batch plant shall be issued. The permit shall contain an expiration date and shall not be transferable to any other construction company or individual. Further, the permit shall be limited to a specific construction project which is identified by project number and shall not be transferable to any other construction project. (Code 1981 § 40-401. Code 1995 § 130-126.)",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.010:block:13#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 12.45.010 block 14",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 14,
          "component_id": "6b988e3d-2235-5ced-a35b-03e91a5cabae",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2358,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.010:block:14",
          "start": 2277
        },
        "quote": "Cross References: City Engineer, TMC 2.20.100 ; Traffic Engineer, TMC 10.10.010 .",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.010:block:14#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
